# Terraform caches, local configuration, plans, and state
**/.terraform/*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
*.tfvars
!*.tfvars.example
*.tfbackend
!*.tfbackend.example
crash.log
crash.*.log
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
__pycache__/
.venv/
**/bin/
**/obj/
*.zip
# Commit .terraform.lock.hcl to keep provider selections reproducible.
